    "northStar": "A clear workspace for the next repair",
    "overview": "The public site presents a practical desktop product with generous spacing, calm near-black surfaces and a warm gold identity. The user's pinned reference, Cerberus Tool Pro, informs capsule navigation, the paired hero and contrasting annual card. ArepaTool content, colors and assets remain authoritative.",
